ar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5629979?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro","html_url":"https://github.com/waltribeiro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waltribeiro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T22:52:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T22:52:12Z","body":"Confirming on macOS / Apple Silicon, so this now spans Windows (x86), Linux, and macOS (ARM), and both Direct3D 12 and Metal. That points at the core serialization path rather than anything platform- or renderer-specific.\n\n`Godot v4.7.stable - macOS 15.7.5 - Metal (Forward+) - Apple M2 Max - 96 GiB RAM`\n\nA single-node rename freezes ~90s (occasionally ~2 min) with ~2,800 animations stored inline in the scene; instant in 4.6.3.rc1. The freeze scales with serialized volume, not available resources, so it isn't memory- or CPU-bound. Matches the inline-animation root cause above.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4763536569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]